WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Stitch a chain border. Mark six points
6 mm apart beside it.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Come up at the first mark with a beading needle.
Pick up two small beads and one tip bead.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Skip the tip bead. Pass back through
the first two beads in reverse order.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Take the needle down beside the first hole.
Pull gently until the beads rest on the cloth.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Repeat at the other marks. Point each tip
away from the chain and fasten on the back.
